    "module_designation": "Ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device",
    "description": "Compact ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume of clean water in residential use. Measurement is based on the ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle (difference in time-of-flight of ultrasonic pulses with and against the flow). Can be installed in horizontal position with indication device on top or in vertical position; not designed for measurement of reverse flow. Integrated equipment/functions: optical interface, NB-IoT, M-Bus, RS-485, RF, Pulse, Sigfox (optional), LoRaWAN, W-MBus. Protected against unauthorized manipulation by two lead seals."
